WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.240 --> 00:04.200
- Do you know anyone who is well-connected in Thonburi?

4
00:04.360 --> 00:06.360
- Hongsen Gaoyod.

5
00:06.680 --> 00:08.160
- Ever since you got out of prison,

6
00:08.480 --> 00:10.040
- we haven’t had a chance to get together for a round.

7
00:10.280 --> 00:11.000
- How about now?

8
00:11.000 --> 00:11.640
- Asshole!

9
00:13.880 --> 00:15.520
- What if you owed me?

10
00:15.640 --> 00:17.040
- Would you pay me back?

11
00:18.040 --> 00:19.200
- Yes, but it’s unlikely.

12
00:19.360 --> 00:22.840
- Because I will never need your help.

13
00:23.880 --> 00:25.360
- I don’t beat you up.

14
00:25.640 --> 00:27.520
- That means I already repaid you.

15
00:27.800 --> 00:29.200
- You still owe me.

16
00:29.920 --> 00:31.040
- You have to accept me into your gang.

17
01:09.520 --> 01:11.240
Sen, you look so cool.

18
01:14.400 --> 01:15.280
I’m not that cool.

19
01:15.360 --> 01:17.440
Wow!

20
01:21.240 --> 01:21.800
Hello.

21
01:25.760 --> 01:26.680
My name is Yong.

22
01:27.600 --> 01:28.280
I…

23
01:28.760 --> 01:30.440
I’m a new member of the Gaoyod Gang.

24
01:34.840 --> 01:36.320
Please look after me.

25
01:41.320 --> 01:41.680
Hey.

26
01:44.680 --> 01:45.280
Hello.

27
01:46.680 --> 01:47.760
Wait.

28
01:48.520 --> 01:49.760
What are you doing?

29
01:50.440 --> 01:52.760
Don’t you know that we don’t accept new members?

30
01:52.760 --> 01:53.160
Yes.

31
01:53.880 --> 01:55.360
But Hongsen accepted me into the gang.

32
02:00.120 --> 02:01.160
You hate gangsters.

33
02:01.320 --> 02:02.960
Why do you want to work for me?

34
02:05.000 --> 02:06.560
You hate gangsters.

35
02:06.560 --> 02:08.760
How are you going to work for Hongsen?

36
02:10.720 --> 02:11.760
Yes, I hate them.

37
02:12.480 --> 02:14.120
But if he can help find my mom,

38
02:14.440 --> 02:15.720
I’ll go work for him.

39
02:15.960 --> 02:17.600
What are you going to do?

40
02:17.840 --> 02:21.360
I’ll show him my sincerity to earn his acceptance.

41
02:27.520 --> 02:28.160
Sen.

42
02:28.560 --> 02:29.680
Sen, wait.

43
02:30.160 --> 02:30.920
Hey!

44
02:33.080 --> 02:34.280
I’ll be honest with you.

45
02:35.240 --> 02:36.760
The gangsters that I hate

46
02:37.200 --> 02:39.320
are those thugs who rob and steal from others.

47
02:40.600 --> 02:43.760
But Hongsen Gaoyod is not like that.

48
02:44.960 --> 02:47.680
For me, I admire only you.

49
02:48.360 --> 02:49.240
To tell you the truth,

50
02:50.320 --> 02:52.760
you are the coolest guy in both Phra Nakorn and Thonburi.

51
02:53.960 --> 02:54.920
You are good-looking.

52
02:55.600 --> 02:57.120
Your hair looks great.

53
02:57.800 --> 02:59.440
If I’m going to join a gang,

54
02:59.920 --> 03:01.160
it must be Gaoyod.

55
03:06.440 --> 03:09.480
Yong, anyone can tell that you are lying.

56
03:09.480 --> 03:09.960
It’s so exaggerated.

57
03:09.960 --> 03:11.160
Try again.

58
03:14.320 --> 03:17.280
To be honest, I have no place to go, Sen.

59
03:17.720 --> 03:19.080
I have no money.

60
03:20.680 --> 03:22.840
My debtor is going after me.

61
03:23.280 --> 03:26.520
That’s why you want to stay here under Sen’s protection.

62
03:29.480 --> 03:30.760
I’m begging you.

63
03:37.680 --> 03:39.040
I don’t believe a single word that you say.

64
03:54.360 --> 03:56.080
Aren’t you going to repay me?

65
03:58.120 --> 03:59.840
I saved your life twice.

66
04:01.840 --> 04:03.360
You said you would repay me.

67
04:03.920 --> 04:05.000
Didn’t you mean to keep your word?

68
04:05.440 --> 04:07.000
Hongsen Gaoyod,

69
04:08.000 --> 04:09.760
you are a faithless gangster.

70
05:29.960 --> 05:31.440
Can’t you work harder?

71
05:31.440 --> 05:32.200
Come on.

72
05:33.280 --> 05:34.880
Be careful.

73
05:35.680 --> 05:36.160
Zeng.

74
05:36.400 --> 05:36.760
Zeng.

75
05:37.680 --> 05:39.200
Asshole, that’s my snack.

76
05:39.640 --> 05:40.280
Can I have it?

77
05:40.280 --> 05:40.600
Zeng.

78
05:40.800 --> 05:41.600
What?

79
05:41.800 --> 05:43.320
I asked people in the market.

80
05:43.960 --> 05:44.800
The market in Thonburi.

81
05:44.920 --> 05:45.240
And?

82
05:45.600 --> 05:47.280
Someone saw him.

83
05:50.680 --> 05:51.720
But I don’t know where he is right now.

84
05:53.600 --> 05:54.800
Find him.

85
05:55.320 --> 05:56.800
I want to know what he’s doing there.

86
05:58.400 --> 05:59.200
What if I can’t find him?

87
06:02.320 --> 06:03.680
If you can’t find him?

88
06:08.920 --> 06:10.960
I’ll kick your ass!

89
06:10.960 --> 06:11.880
Ouch, bro.

90
06:12.480 --> 06:13.520
Go find him.

91
06:13.640 --> 06:14.560
Yes, I’m going.

92
06:24.720 --> 06:26.160
How can I do everything by myself?

93
06:26.360 --> 06:27.640
If you can’t do it,

94
06:28.840 --> 06:30.080
then get the hell out of here.

95
06:57.440 --> 06:59.000
Damn.

96
07:00.320 --> 07:01.520
This is so gross.

97
07:02.920 --> 07:04.240
Take the garbage out.

98
07:04.600 --> 07:05.840
But I’m washing these clothes.

99
07:05.960 --> 07:06.640
Fine.

100
07:12.960 --> 07:13.560
What?

101
07:19.400 --> 07:20.920
Just wait until I get my turn.

102
07:21.960 --> 07:23.040
If you can’t do it,

103
07:25.000 --> 07:25.920
then go home.

104
07:27.280 --> 07:28.040
I won’t.

105
07:33.600 --> 07:34.400
I’m Yong.

106
07:34.960 --> 07:36.080
I’m not giving up easily.

107
07:36.240 --> 07:36.960
Mark my words.

108
07:52.880 --> 07:53.640
Zoe.

109
07:54.200 --> 07:55.000
Clear the table.

110
07:56.120 --> 07:56.880
Yes, boss.

111
08:04.440 --> 08:05.440
Get out!

112
08:06.920 --> 08:07.720
Get out!

113
08:11.920 --> 08:13.600
Hey, clear the table.

114
08:15.440 --> 08:16.640
Sure. Wait a sec.

115
08:26.720 --> 08:27.840
I’ll have four black coffees.

116
08:28.240 --> 08:29.560
I’ll deduct it from your interest.

117
08:31.040 --> 08:32.760
Fine.

118
08:34.320 --> 08:37.800
Is your gang so broke that you have to bully people for free food?

119
08:39.320 --> 08:40.120
That’s none of your business.

120
08:42.440 --> 08:43.680
I’m just curious.

121
08:44.400 --> 08:45.480
You again?!

122
08:52.320 --> 08:54.080
Do you have a problem with my men?

123
08:54.880 --> 08:59.000
Gangsters like you take advantage even of an old man?

124
08:59.960 --> 09:03.080
If you’re not like that, then tell your men to pay for the coffee.

125
09:03.360 --> 09:03.840
Pay?

126
09:05.960 --> 09:07.760
Didn’t I give you money to buy food?

127
09:08.760 --> 09:10.240
We’re about to pay it.

128
09:11.080 --> 09:12.000
You’re about to pay it?

129
09:12.240 --> 09:13.200
Jackass.

130
09:13.560 --> 09:14.280
Heh.

131
09:17.000 --> 09:17.520
Move.

132
09:20.320 --> 09:21.000
Heh?

133
09:22.200 --> 09:23.000
What is your problem now?

134
09:23.640 --> 09:24.880
Didn’t you say ‘Heh’?

135
09:25.720 --> 09:26.080
Heh?

136
09:26.160 --> 09:27.960
You said, ‘Heh, heh, heh.’

137
09:28.280 --> 09:28.960
Why did you say that?

138
09:29.640 --> 09:30.480
What does it mean?

139
09:31.320 --> 09:32.360
Are you laughing at me?

140
09:32.640 --> 09:33.080
Hey.

141
09:33.160 --> 09:33.560
Hey?

142
09:34.000 --> 09:34.600
Hey!

143
09:35.480 --> 09:37.640
I’m the only one who can scold my men.

144
09:38.320 --> 09:42.560
You have no right to huff and puff at them.

145
09:44.320 --> 09:45.000
Where are you going?

146
09:45.000 --> 09:45.320
What?

147
09:47.840 --> 09:49.640
Zeng, I’m begging you.

148
09:49.880 --> 09:51.320
He doesn’t know who you are.

149
09:52.080 --> 09:52.880
Can you let him go this time?

150
09:53.120 --> 09:54.920
Come on. Calm down.

151
09:55.200 --> 09:56.080
Have a seat. Come on.

152
09:56.480 --> 09:57.280
I’m begging you.

153
09:57.600 --> 09:58.600
Sit down.

154
09:58.920 --> 10:00.440
Calm down.

155
10:00.560 --> 10:01.520
Sit down.

156
10:01.520 --> 10:02.480
Sit down.

157
10:02.600 --> 10:03.520
Have a seat.

158
10:04.000 --> 10:04.720
You’ll have your usual, right?

159
10:06.320 --> 10:07.160
Zoe.

160
10:07.560 --> 10:08.600
Come and help me.

161
10:10.440 --> 10:11.080
Come on.

162
10:23.520 --> 10:24.840
Hello, Father.

163
10:25.240 --> 10:26.520
What is this about?

164
10:26.920 --> 10:28.280
I brought something for you.

165
10:30.120 --> 10:30.600
You!

166
10:32.960 --> 10:34.320
What’s wrong?

167
10:36.000 --> 10:37.000
Nothing.

168
10:40.800 --> 10:41.520
Can I have it?

169
10:43.320 --> 10:44.560
You don’t need it anymore.

170
10:45.040 --> 10:46.040
From now on,

171
10:46.640 --> 10:49.400
you will stay cool because of the Buddha’s teachings

172
10:49.480 --> 10:50.200
and…

173
10:51.520 --> 10:53.000
This.

174
10:53.480 --> 10:54.640
A fan.

175
10:55.280 --> 10:58.360
The fan costs as much as a half ounce of gold.

176
10:58.720 --> 10:59.920
I’m telling you,

177
11:00.040 --> 11:04.880
no one would be as generous as Zeng.

178
11:06.480 --> 11:07.520
Thank you.

179
11:08.080 --> 11:09.560
But you should take it back.

180
11:11.160 --> 11:12.520
You don’t need to feel burdened.

181
11:12.760 --> 11:14.000
You saved my life.

182
11:14.240 --> 11:15.560
This is the least I can do for you.

183
11:15.720 --> 11:17.120
I’m not feeling burdened.

184
11:17.520 --> 11:19.600
I want to accept it.

185
11:20.400 --> 11:21.840
But there’s a problem.

186
11:24.320 --> 11:25.040
What is it?

187
11:25.360 --> 11:26.040
This temple…

188
11:26.920 --> 11:28.160
has no electricity.

189
11:32.520 --> 11:33.320
What are you laughing at?

190
11:37.760 --> 11:38.600
I’ll fan you.

191
11:45.800 --> 11:47.280
That’s not a problem.

192
11:47.440 --> 11:48.880
I’ll take care of it.

193
11:49.280 --> 11:49.960
Din.

194
11:49.960 --> 11:50.320
Yes.

195
11:50.640 --> 11:52.040
Contact the electricity authority

196
11:52.200 --> 11:55.040
and connect the temple to the power grid right away.

197
11:58.120 --> 11:59.640
Yes, sir.

198
12:07.080 --> 12:07.920
Hey, Zoe!

199
12:09.360 --> 12:12.520
Don’t ever think that you can mess with me because you work for Father.

200
12:12.800 --> 12:14.040
I may let it slide when we are in the temple.

201
12:14.360 --> 12:15.960
But outside, I’ll teach you a lesson.

202
12:16.720 --> 12:17.640
Fine.

203
12:18.800 --> 12:20.520
You should hurry and connect the temple to the power grid.

204
12:21.040 --> 12:22.960
Do it quickly. I’m hot.

205
12:23.200 --> 12:25.400
Oops, I mean, Father is hot.v

206
12:25.400 --> 12:26.160
Asshole.

207
12:28.160 --> 12:29.760
Is there no temple in Phra Nakorn?

208
12:30.840 --> 12:32.600
Why did you come here to make merit?

209
12:34.800 --> 12:35.920
Did you build the temple?

210
12:36.320 --> 12:37.360
Is it yours?

211
12:37.720 --> 12:39.840
Father was my father’s friend.

212
12:40.160 --> 12:42.520
If I want to come here to make merit,

213
12:44.040 --> 12:44.760
what are you going to do?

214
12:44.760 --> 12:45.680
I’m not going to do anything.

215
12:46.120 --> 12:47.040
I just can’t stand the sight of you.

216
12:47.520 --> 12:48.320
Sen.

217
12:52.320 --> 12:54.200
Hey, stop it.

218
12:54.720 --> 12:56.360
You are in the temple.

219
12:57.480 --> 13:00.560
Don’t you have some respect for monks?

220
13:02.200 --> 13:05.280
You are always fighting. Everyone is so sick of you.

221
13:09.320 --> 13:13.120
Were you two used to be good friends?

222
13:14.000 --> 13:16.040
Why do you keep fighting?

223
13:16.480 --> 13:17.560
Father.

224
13:18.440 --> 13:20.680
How can I be nice to the man who killed my father?

225
13:20.680 --> 13:21.360
I didn’t do it.

226
13:21.480 --> 13:22.240
You did.

227
13:23.160 --> 13:24.920
Father, how can I be friends with this idiot?

228
13:24.920 --> 13:25.640
You, idiot.

229
13:25.640 --> 13:26.280
You are an idiot.

230
13:26.840 --> 13:27.440
There.

231
13:28.160 --> 13:29.680
You both are idiots.

232
13:30.280 --> 13:31.440
Should I hit you again?

233
13:32.560 --> 13:33.480
Father, calm down.

234
13:34.600 --> 13:37.160
You know that anger and hatred are toxic.

235
13:37.880 --> 13:39.520
But you still chose to consume them.

236
13:40.280 --> 13:42.680
You let them eat you up inside.

237
13:43.240 --> 13:45.320
If there’s a way to end the cycle,

238
13:45.680 --> 13:46.960
you should do it.

239
13:47.480 --> 13:48.560
I have ended it.

240
13:49.400 --> 13:50.480
I ended my friendship with him.

241
13:51.440 --> 13:52.640
Is that a dog barking?

242
13:52.640 --> 13:53.560
I’m not a f*cking dog.

243
13:54.680 --> 13:59.120
Since you are teaching us, can you teach us a little more?

244
14:00.000 --> 14:04.640
It may help someone repent for the sins he’s committed.

245
14:04.720 --> 14:06.400
That’s enough. Cut it out.

246
14:07.320 --> 14:09.480
If you don’t stop, I’ll teach you a lesson.

247
14:17.960 --> 14:19.480
My father’s ashes are stored here.

248
14:20.160 --> 14:21.360
If I don't come here,

249
14:22.640 --> 14:23.680
where else am I supposed to go?

250
14:28.280 --> 14:30.320
Have you ever thought about asking my father for forgiveness?

251
14:31.080 --> 14:32.040
I told you.

252
14:32.760 --> 14:33.960
I didn’t kill your father.

253
14:33.960 --> 14:35.320
You killed him.

254
14:37.440 --> 14:38.920
I’ll ask you one more time.

255
14:40.040 --> 14:42.920
Have you ever thought about asking my father for forgiveness?

256
14:49.880 --> 14:51.160
Zeng, we are in the temple.

257
14:52.200 --> 14:52.640
Let’s go.

258
14:54.280 --> 14:54.800
Come on.

259
15:48.400 --> 15:49.520
What’s wrong, boss?

260
15:54.800 --> 15:55.640
Do you need a comb?

261
15:56.560 --> 15:57.480
You look like a mess.

262
16:05.840 --> 16:06.640
No?

263
16:09.800 --> 16:10.560
Yong.

264
16:12.600 --> 16:13.280
Come up here.

265
16:46.360 --> 16:47.280
Take your top off.

266
16:48.200 --> 16:48.640
Huh?

267
16:51.280 --> 16:51.720
Hey.

268
16:52.440 --> 16:54.320
What are you doing, Sen?

269
16:55.720 --> 16:57.320
You’ve been wearing the same top since yesterday.

270
16:59.240 --> 17:00.000
Damn.

271
17:01.200 --> 17:01.720
You stink.

272
17:02.160 --> 17:03.440
Why don’t you change your clothes?

273
17:07.080 --> 17:08.520
Stink? But I took a shower.

274
17:10.080 --> 17:11.800
I didn’t bring any clothes.

275
17:20.000 --> 17:20.520
Fine.

276
17:21.960 --> 17:22.720
I’ll borrow it.

277
17:24.640 --> 17:25.160
Wait.

278
17:35.000 --> 17:35.760
I don’t need underwear.

279
17:36.680 --> 17:37.640
I already washed it.

280
17:38.080 --> 17:39.800
Do you want to get jock itch?

281
17:42.560 --> 17:43.160
Wear it.

282
17:43.880 --> 17:45.520
I don’t want my new pants to be ruined.

283
17:47.240 --> 17:47.880
Fine.

284
17:50.040 --> 17:50.560
Hey.

285
17:51.760 --> 17:52.440
Change your clothes here.

286
17:56.200 --> 17:57.080
Are you crazy?

287
17:58.680 --> 17:59.120
Why?

288
18:02.480 --> 18:03.320
Are you shy?

289
18:07.520 --> 18:08.320
Is it small?

290
18:15.240 --> 18:15.960
Is it small?

291
18:35.400 --> 18:36.280
Happy?

292
18:44.320 --> 18:45.160
Is it too big?

293
18:46.040 --> 18:46.800
A little.

294
18:48.200 --> 18:49.240
It would be strange if it wasn’t too big.

295
18:50.160 --> 18:51.400
Mine is big.

296
18:53.120 --> 18:53.680
I mean, my waistline.

297
18:54.400 --> 18:55.400
What are you thinking?

298
18:57.880 --> 18:58.600
Yes.

299
18:59.080 --> 18:59.880
I know it’s big.

300
19:02.320 --> 19:03.440
I mean, your waistline.

301
19:04.600 --> 19:06.160
You keep talking about it.

302
19:08.360 --> 19:08.840
Hey.

303
19:12.120 --> 19:13.520
Take my clothes and wash them.

304
19:33.320 --> 19:34.400
I’m so happy.

305
19:40.320 --> 19:43.720
The neck feels itchy. Scratch it.

306
19:44.080 --> 19:45.160
Good.

307
19:45.720 --> 19:47.040
Well done.

308
19:49.760 --> 19:51.080
Listen up.

309
19:52.160 --> 19:53.880
Does anyone want to play chess against Zeng?

310
19:54.160 --> 19:56.000
If you win, Zeng will pay for your interest.

311
19:56.160 --> 19:57.000
If you lose,

312
19:57.520 --> 20:00.520
you will have to pay the interest and crawl like a dog.

313
20:01.120 --> 20:03.800
It’s a win-win. Anyone?

314
20:04.560 --> 20:08.080
What if I can’t pay both the principal and the interest?

315
20:12.400 --> 20:13.800
Then you need to play against him.

316
20:13.960 --> 20:14.320
Come on.

317
20:15.120 --> 20:16.400
Come here. Be the first one.

318
20:17.600 --> 20:19.680
Zeng, I don’t know how to play chess.

319
20:19.840 --> 20:22.480
Just play it. It won’t take long.

320
20:22.600 --> 20:23.960
Don’t you want to reduce your debt?

321
20:25.080 --> 20:26.160
Let me play on your behalf.

322
20:27.920 --> 20:28.880
You don’t mind it, do you?

323
20:31.080 --> 20:31.680
No.

324
20:32.560 --> 20:33.800
If you lose,

325
20:34.240 --> 20:35.840
you have to crawl like a dog around the shop

326
20:35.840 --> 20:36.920
and howl.

327
20:39.680 --> 20:40.600
Do you dare?

328
20:43.720 --> 20:45.000
Just around the shop? That’s not fun.

329
20:46.040 --> 20:47.160
How about crawling around the market?

330
20:49.160 --> 20:49.760
Do you dare?

331
20:55.200 --> 20:56.840
You are bringing it on yourself.

332
21:28.560 --> 21:29.200
Kla.

333
21:33.000 --> 21:33.560
Yong.

334
21:34.800 --> 21:35.360
Yes.

335
21:35.360 --> 21:36.600
has work for you.

336
21:37.440 --> 21:38.120
Me?

337
21:39.440 --> 21:40.120
What is it?

338
21:40.360 --> 21:41.480
You need to do it.

339
21:41.840 --> 21:42.960
If you can do it,

340
21:43.520 --> 21:45.040
Sen will accept you into the gang.

341
21:45.760 --> 21:46.560
Really?

342
21:47.880 --> 21:49.840
Den, just tell me. I’ll do anything.

343
21:52.080 --> 21:52.760
Good.

344
22:05.480 --> 22:08.160
Instead of advancing a pawn first to control of the center,

345
22:08.680 --> 22:09.920
he moves his knight first.

346
22:10.880 --> 22:11.920
Does he know how to play chess?

347
22:17.360 --> 22:18.880
I think this game will be over quickly.

348
22:30.240 --> 22:31.480
You can start crawling now.

349
22:31.880 --> 22:32.640
I don’t mind.

350
22:32.640 --> 22:37.160
Ah-woo.

351
22:40.680 --> 22:41.760
The real game begins now.

352
22:55.480 --> 22:56.880
How did the tables turn so completely?

353
23:09.840 --> 23:10.560
Taken.

354
23:13.240 --> 23:14.240
He’s definitely cheating.

355
23:14.400 --> 23:15.720
Zeng was at an advantage.

356
23:15.920 --> 23:17.480
How did he turn the game around with just one move?

357
23:26.080 --> 23:26.560
Check.

358
23:34.640 --> 23:36.080
You are definitely cheating.

359
23:36.560 --> 23:37.800
Yes, you are cheating.

360
23:37.880 --> 23:39.000
Let’s call it off.

361
23:39.320 --> 23:40.560
This game doesn’t count.

362
23:40.800 --> 23:41.960
Zeng is being cheated.

363
23:42.240 --> 23:43.400
Let’s go.

364
23:43.880 --> 23:44.400
Zeng.

365
23:45.320 --> 23:46.200
Come on. Let’s go.

366
23:49.320 --> 23:50.360
You are cheating.

367
23:53.000 --> 23:54.600
Thank you.

368
24:00.560 --> 24:01.840
I think he will make it.

369
24:04.800 --> 24:05.720
No way.

370
24:07.000 --> 24:11.120
Since we have different opinions, let’s bet on it.

371
24:11.840 --> 24:12.640
Sure.

372
24:12.640 --> 24:14.360
I’m in.

373
24:14.840 --> 24:15.800
No way.

374
24:16.800 --> 24:17.320
Hey.

375
24:21.000 --> 24:22.400
Make it? What are you talking about?

376
24:27.440 --> 24:28.240
Where is Yong?

377
24:31.840 --> 24:33.560
I sent him to collect money from Uncle Saman.

378
24:35.040 --> 24:35.760
Uncle Saman.

379
24:37.280 --> 24:38.320
Where did you send him to?

380
24:38.880 --> 24:39.960
You know where he is.

381
24:45.880 --> 24:46.320
He’s dead.

382
24:47.320 --> 24:48.400
He doesn’t stand a chance.

383
24:50.160 --> 24:51.760
Let’s wait and see.

384
24:55.440 --> 24:57.320
Come on. Hit the cards.

385
24:57.960 --> 25:00.040
Hurry up. I’m having a stroke of good luck.

386
25:08.080 --> 25:09.200
What do you want to play?

387
25:10.080 --> 25:10.920
I’m not here to play.

388
25:11.560 --> 25:13.640
I’m looking for a man named Saman.

389
25:13.640 --> 25:14.520
Do you know him?

390
25:14.640 --> 25:15.440
Saman?

391
25:15.720 --> 25:16.440
Yes, Saman.

392
25:16.920 --> 25:18.840
He’s the man in a white shirt over there.

393
25:18.840 --> 25:20.000
He’s at the last table.

394
25:20.920 --> 25:23.000
Place your bet. You will win.

395
25:25.560 --> 25:28.720
My cards are high again.

396
25:30.600 --> 25:32.200
May I?

397
25:32.600 --> 25:34.080
This round is mine.

398
25:36.080 --> 25:37.800
I’m getting rich.

399
25:40.000 --> 25:40.720
Uncle Saman.

400
25:43.720 --> 25:44.600
Are you Uncle Saman?

401
25:44.600 --> 25:45.680
Yes, that’s me.

402
25:46.200 --> 25:50.640
Hongsen told me to collect the money that you owe him.

403
25:52.440 --> 25:54.800
What did you say? Who sent you?

404
25:55.400 --> 25:58.160
Hongsen, Hongsen Gaoyod.

405
26:17.640 --> 26:18.240
Boss.

406
26:19.000 --> 26:20.320
Hongsen’s man is here.

407
26:28.760 --> 26:30.360
Shit. I’ll quit.

408
26:30.360 --> 26:31.240
My luck is going bad.

409
26:31.600 --> 26:32.320
I’m done.

410
26:33.000 --> 26:33.680
I don’t want to play anymore.

411
26:33.680 --> 26:34.720
Uncle, you got the money from winning the game.

412
26:34.720 --> 26:35.840
You should pay me back.

413
26:36.640 --> 26:37.600
At least pay half back.

414
26:37.680 --> 26:38.080
Hey.

415
26:39.680 --> 26:41.280
How dare you step on my turf?

416
26:41.800 --> 26:43.360
Do you think you can walk out easily?

417
26:44.280 --> 26:45.080
Uncle.

418
27:05.600 --> 27:06.520
Hello.

419
27:14.800 --> 27:18.000
A mangy dog looks better than you.

420
27:19.560 --> 27:25.280
Go back to your boss and tell him that Tot misses him.

421
27:26.760 --> 27:27.760
You don’t need to do that.

422
27:28.560 --> 27:29.880
I’m here to hear what you have to say.

423
27:31.160 --> 27:31.880
Sen.

424
27:45.360 --> 27:46.880
I’m here just to take my man back.

425
27:47.400 --> 27:48.240
I don’t want to pick a fight.

426
27:53.080 --> 27:53.880
You are with me.

427
27:54.560 --> 27:55.600
You don’t need to be afraid.

428
28:06.000 --> 28:06.880
Sen.

429
28:16.760 --> 28:17.480
Sen.

430
28:18.320 --> 28:18.960
Sen.

431
28:33.320 --> 28:33.960
Sen.

432
28:36.560 --> 28:37.440
Sen.

433
28:38.720 --> 28:39.320
Sen.

434
28:56.560 --> 28:57.200
Stop it.

435
28:58.840 --> 29:00.440
Your boss is as great as they say.

436
29:00.680 --> 29:02.040
You should worry about yourself. Move.

437
29:04.000 --> 29:04.400
Sen.

438
29:10.520 --> 29:11.080
Sen.

439
29:52.040 --> 29:53.280
You think you can take me on?

440
29:56.720 --> 29:58.040
Do it if you dare.

441
30:07.720 --> 30:08.240
Yong.

442
30:39.360 --> 30:40.400
If you are here to pick a fight,

443
30:41.280 --> 30:42.160
you should leave.

444
30:43.840 --> 30:45.040
The game is over.

445
30:50.760 --> 30:51.880
I didn’t come here to pick a fight.

446
30:57.280 --> 30:58.880
I’m here to admit that I lost.

447
31:00.760 --> 31:02.280
Though my man knocked the board over,

448
31:03.400 --> 31:04.880
I know I lost the game.

449
31:09.080 --> 31:09.800
Forget it.

450
31:11.000 --> 31:12.080
It’s just the past.

451
31:15.880 --> 31:16.440
Hey.

452
31:17.640 --> 31:18.600
What are you doing?

453
31:27.520 --> 31:29.160
I have my pride.

454
31:30.840 --> 31:31.680
Get up.

455
31:31.680 --> 31:32.600
I don’t want to see it.

456
31:32.880 --> 31:33.320
Get up.

457
31:33.320 --> 31:33.800
Hey.

458
31:36.480 --> 31:37.760
I want to change the conditions.

459
31:38.720 --> 31:40.240
You can pay me back later.

460
31:41.080 --> 31:42.320
I gave you my word.

461
31:43.360 --> 31:44.640
I won’t change it.

462
31:46.240 --> 31:49.240
Ah-woo.

463
31:50.120 --> 31:52.720
Ah-woo.

464
31:52.720 --> 31:57.360
Ah-woo.

465
31:57.720 --> 32:01.040
Ah-woo.

466
32:02.520 --> 32:03.960
Ah-woo.

467
32:03.960 --> 32:07.560
Ah-woo.

468
32:08.320 --> 32:11.160
Ah-woo.

469
32:25.640 --> 32:27.440
Cheng paid his debt back to me.

470
32:28.640 --> 32:30.560
I guess you didn’t tell him that I lost in the chess game.

471
32:32.760 --> 32:33.960
It’s not my business to tell him.

472
32:43.800 --> 32:45.480
If you’re going to pick a fight,

473
32:46.400 --> 32:47.400
just leave.

474
32:49.200 --> 32:50.520
If you are going to stay,

475
32:54.120 --> 32:55.000
then help me sweep the floor.

476
32:57.280 --> 32:58.800
Do I look like I work for you?

477
33:00.160 --> 33:02.320
If you want to do that, I don’t mind.

478
33:02.760 --> 33:03.440
Take it.

479
33:08.520 --> 33:10.000
Can I ask you something?

480
33:10.520 --> 33:11.840
Seriously.

481
33:12.960 --> 33:14.120
Aren’t you afraid of me?

482
33:15.280 --> 33:16.960
You and I are both humans.

483
33:18.120 --> 33:19.640
When you became a ghost,

484
33:19.640 --> 33:20.520
I might be scared of you.

485
33:21.480 --> 33:23.080
Jackass.

486
33:23.600 --> 33:24.480
Sweep the floor.

487
33:24.480 --> 33:25.840
I’m praying.

488
33:26.360 --> 33:29.320
I hope that the ghost at the temple’s cemetery will haunt you.

489
33:30.080 --> 33:31.120
I’ll wait until you become a ghost.

490
33:32.160 --> 33:33.560
When I die, I will haunt you.

491
33:33.840 --> 33:34.800
You would be the first one I haunt.

492
33:35.000 --> 33:35.840
I can’t wait.

493
33:36.000 --> 33:37.840
I hope you die by tomorrow.

494
33:37.960 --> 33:39.200
Then I would ride on your shoulders.

495
33:39.240 --> 33:40.840
Get ready to have shoulder pain.

496
33:40.840 --> 33:41.920
Sweep the floor under that table.

497
33:41.920 --> 33:42.720
It’s so dirty.

498
33:42.720 --> 33:43.600
You’re talking too much.

499
33:43.760 --> 33:45.080
Why is there only one broomstick?

500
33:51.160 --> 33:51.800
Sen.

501
33:52.600 --> 33:53.440
Can I take a break?

502
34:03.360 --> 34:04.400
What were you thinking?

503
34:05.840 --> 34:07.440
Why did you go into Tot Damding’s turf alone?

504
34:10.320 --> 34:12.280
I only thought that if I could collect the money,

505
34:13.000 --> 34:14.720
you would accept me into your gang.

506
34:16.440 --> 34:17.240
Did you get it?

507
34:36.840 --> 34:38.040
You want to join my gang so much

508
34:39.080 --> 34:40.880
that you risked your life for it?

509
34:40.880 --> 34:42.200
How would I know that it was a dangerous place?

510
34:42.880 --> 34:44.560
If it was that dangerous, you wouldn’t send your man there alone,

511
34:44.560 --> 34:45.120
right?

512
34:59.280 --> 35:00.120
What?

513
35:01.880 --> 35:02.600
I’m scared.

514
35:03.760 --> 35:04.760
You are so weak.

515
35:05.400 --> 35:05.960
Stay still.

516
35:23.240 --> 35:24.080
The wound on your temple,

517
35:26.440 --> 35:27.640
don’t forget to treat it when you get home.

518
35:28.360 --> 35:29.200
It can be infected.

519
35:31.560 --> 35:33.080
Are you accepting me into your gang?

520
35:34.160 --> 35:35.680
You told him you came to take your man back.

521
35:35.680 --> 35:37.520
Doesn’t it mean that I’m your henchman?

522
35:40.200 --> 35:41.480
When I said my man,

523
35:41.960 --> 35:43.120
I didn’t mean that you were my henchman.

524
35:44.040 --> 35:44.800
What does it mean?

525
35:47.120 --> 35:48.320
It means you are my man.

526
35:56.360 --> 35:56.840
I got it.

527
36:01.360 --> 36:01.840
Go home.

528
36:02.720 --> 36:03.600
Get your wound treated.

529
36:18.720 --> 36:20.080
Ouch. Kradat, it hurts.

530
36:20.480 --> 36:21.440
Hang in there.

531
36:27.160 --> 36:29.200
It’s not a big deal that he didn’t accept you into the gang.

532
36:29.640 --> 36:30.760
We can find another way.

533
36:31.880 --> 36:34.360
Your brother is well-connected.

534
36:34.400 --> 36:36.240
I think he can help you find your mom.

535
36:36.880 --> 36:38.440
He’s the worst.

536
36:39.320 --> 36:41.040
He doesn’t want me to look for her.

537
36:41.840 --> 36:43.120
He doesn’t want to see her.

538
36:43.120 --> 36:44.080
So he forbids me from looking for her.

539
36:44.800 --> 36:45.480
He’s a control freak.

540
36:48.280 --> 36:49.640
Is someone gossiping about me?

541
36:51.120 --> 36:51.880
Zeng.

542
36:55.880 --> 36:56.520
What?

543
36:57.720 --> 36:58.600
Did you find Yong?

544
36:58.760 --> 36:59.440
No.

545
37:00.000 --> 37:01.240
I heard you sneeze.

546
37:01.280 --> 37:01.880
So I came in to check on you.

547
37:07.720 --> 37:08.120
Din.

548
37:10.880 --> 37:12.280
Send our men to Thonburi to look for him.

549
37:12.840 --> 37:14.160
I’m sure Yong is there.

550
37:14.720 --> 37:15.920
No matter what,

551
37:16.120 --> 37:18.320
I will never go back and ask my brother for help.

552
37:19.000 --> 37:20.520
What are you going to do?

553
37:22.080 --> 37:22.920
I don’t know.

554
37:24.680 --> 37:25.280
I ran out of ideas.

555
37:27.880 --> 37:29.280
Hongsen Gaoyod.

556
37:30.640 --> 37:32.960
I thought he was a good man with morals.

557
37:33.200 --> 37:36.760
But he actually sent me to his enemy to be beaten up.

558
37:37.920 --> 37:38.840
I almost died.

559
37:39.320 --> 37:43.120
I acted like he was a kind man by letting me borrow his clothes.

560
37:44.560 --> 37:45.080
So disgusting.

561
37:45.960 --> 37:46.880
Kradat, I’m telling you.

562
37:47.440 --> 37:49.080
I did everything for him.

563
37:49.280 --> 37:53.200
I did the dishes, cleaned the house, and took the trash out.

564
37:53.200 --> 37:54.240
I did all that.

565
37:54.360 --> 37:56.040
Yong, stop it.

566
37:56.160 --> 37:57.200
No, I’m not done, Kradat.

567
37:57.280 --> 37:58.840
He ordered me to clean wrenches.

568
37:59.000 --> 38:00.560
But he didn’t let me eat anything.

569
38:00.560 --> 38:02.480
He treated me like a servant.

570
38:02.560 --> 38:04.560
Doesn’t he know that slavery was abolished?

571
38:06.960 --> 38:07.720
Yes, I know.

572
38:10.920 --> 38:11.720
Oh.

573
38:12.440 --> 38:13.280
Oh.

574
38:14.400 --> 38:15.280
Sen.

575
38:15.760 --> 38:16.400
Hello.

576
38:18.400 --> 38:19.520
You must be really mad at me.

577
38:20.760 --> 38:21.440
Yes.

578
38:22.720 --> 38:24.440
You know that the gambling den belongs to your enemy.

579
38:25.080 --> 38:26.200
How could you send me there alone?

580
38:26.320 --> 38:29.000
Don’t tell me that you didn’t order that.

581
38:29.320 --> 38:30.120
You are the boss.

582
38:30.120 --> 38:31.400
You are responsible for it.

583
38:32.440 --> 38:33.640
Do you want me to get killed?

584
38:35.480 --> 38:36.160
So what?

585
38:37.080 --> 38:38.040
Do you want to punch me?

586
38:38.200 --> 38:38.800
Can I do that?

587
38:50.920 --> 38:52.080
Your punch is so weak.

588
38:52.360 --> 38:53.000
Don’t use it.

589
39:03.200 --> 39:03.800
I’m sorry.

590
39:09.480 --> 39:11.600
Den sent you to Tot’s gambling den alone.

591
39:12.320 --> 39:12.880
I’m sorry about that.

592
39:16.640 --> 39:17.040
Fine.

593
39:18.640 --> 39:19.320
Is that all?

594
39:23.000 --> 39:23.880
I have a question.

595
39:27.520 --> 39:29.280
Why do you want to join my gang so badly?

596
39:43.400 --> 39:44.440
I’m looking for my mom.

597
39:45.320 --> 39:47.240
I heard that she moved to Thonburi.

598
39:48.320 --> 39:50.720
I was told that you are well-connected in the area.

599
40:01.040 --> 40:04.440
So you want to join my gang because you need my help?

600
40:05.760 --> 40:06.280
Yes.

601
40:08.360 --> 40:10.240
You see how we live.

602
40:11.440 --> 40:14.200
Risking our necks all the time isn’t fun.

603
40:14.480 --> 40:15.360
If it’s that so,

604
40:17.560 --> 40:18.960
then why are you still doing it?

605
40:25.920 --> 40:28.960
I have something I have to get done.

606
40:29.800 --> 40:32.880
I have to find my mother.

607
40:52.800 --> 40:54.120
I accept you into my gang.

608
40:57.440 --> 40:57.720
Huh?

609
40:59.920 --> 41:00.520
Why?

610
41:04.640 --> 41:05.160
Go.

611
41:05.880 --> 41:06.440
Go home.

612
41:07.200 --> 41:07.800
Get your wounds treated.

613
41:29.240 --> 41:30.200
Here is the money I borrowed from you.

614
41:31.680 --> 41:33.080
Uncle Saman paid back his debt?

615
41:34.240 --> 41:35.280
You completed your task.

616
41:35.920 --> 41:37.960
I have to accept you into my gang as I promised.

617
41:41.280 --> 41:41.920
This means

618
41:42.560 --> 41:45.640
I’m both your man and your henchman?

619
41:50.400 --> 41:51.040
So…

620
41:53.400 --> 41:54.640
Whatever names I called you earlier,

621
41:55.640 --> 41:56.680
I’ll take them back.

622
41:56.960 --> 41:58.480
Can you forget it?

623
41:59.560 --> 42:00.120
Do you hear me?

624
42:08.320 --> 42:09.600
You are now a part of the Gaoyod Gang.

625
42:10.520 --> 42:11.640
You need to brush your hair.

626
42:12.400 --> 42:13.680
Don’t ruin my reputation.

627
42:17.000 --> 42:17.960
Sure.

628
42:18.240 --> 42:19.520
I’ll do it right now.

629
42:33.160 --> 42:35.160
THONBURI GANGSTERS

630
42:41.880 --> 42:42.800
I look pretty cool.

631
43:00.840 --> 43:02.440
Can I ask you something?

632
43:03.040 --> 43:07.560
Between Hongsen Gaoyod and Zeng Klookfoon,

633
43:08.600 --> 43:09.560
who do you think is better?

634
43:10.600 --> 43:11.520
I think…

635
43:13.680 --> 43:14.440
Hongsen is better.

636
43:15.120 --> 43:17.840
I think Zeng is very tough.

637
43:18.520 --> 43:19.280
How?

638
43:19.760 --> 43:21.160
His gang’s name means rolling in dirt.

639
43:22.080 --> 43:24.200
Doesn’t it mean he must be beaten so often

640
43:24.200 --> 43:25.720
that he’s covered with dirt?

641
43:33.560 --> 43:34.080
Hey.

642
43:36.600 --> 43:40.960
Kiddos, have some respect when talking about my boss.

643
43:41.320 --> 43:42.400
Do you hear me?

644
43:44.200 --> 43:45.360
You can respect your boss.

645
43:45.360 --> 43:46.720
But he’s my son.

646
43:47.320 --> 43:47.800
Go back to your seat.

647
43:48.640 --> 43:49.560
Come on.

648
43:49.840 --> 43:50.440
Do you want to be hit again?

649
43:50.800 --> 43:51.320
That’s enough.

650
43:57.760 --> 43:59.320
Rolling in dirt.

651
44:02.520 --> 44:04.520
- You’d better make everyone in the gang accept you.

652
44:04.760 --> 44:06.160
- Why do you hate me? Just tell me.

653
44:06.160 --> 44:07.920
- What do you have to earn my acceptance?

654
44:08.320 --> 44:09.920
- Compete against me in a shooting match.

655
44:10.360 --> 44:12.320
- If you win, I’ll accept you.

656
44:12.560 --> 44:13.560
- Just wait and see.

657
44:13.760 --> 44:15.440
- I’ll show you that I can beat Den.

658
44:15.440 --> 44:16.360
- We are closed.

659
44:16.360 --> 44:17.480
- You can close the application.

660
44:17.480 --> 44:18.760
- I already applied.

